# Copy to .env and adjust. Every CLI loads .env via python-dotenv at startup.

# Local directory of real genomes used by opt-in tests and dogfooding.
# Tests skip when it is unset or missing. Never copy anything from it into assets/.
JUST_VCF_SAMPLES_DIR=/data/genomes

# Where the loader keeps rewritten copies of inputs polars-bio cannot read as they are (archived VCFs,
# headers needing repair) and the per-facet parquet spills a VCF load writes. Defaults to the
# platform's user cache directory. just_vcf.clear_cache removes entries by source or by age (RM268).
# JUST_VCF_CACHE_DIR=

# Days an entry an older just-vcf version wrote is kept after its last use before load and the derived
# steps sweep it (default 7; 0 sweeps at once). Another session or application on an older version may
# still be reading it. A fraction of a day is allowed; anything but a non-negative number is refused.
# JUST_VCF_CACHE_GRACE_DAYS=7

# The gtars refget store resolve_ref reads REF from (RM3). A FASTA passed to resolve_ref or to
# ReferenceStore.add_fasta is added here once and read from the store after that. Defaults to
# reference/ under the cache directory above. A GRCh38 primary assembly takes about 1.1 GB.
# JUST_VCF_REFERENCE_DIR=

# Directory of ancestry reference panels (docs/ANCESTRY_PANELS.md): Privé's reference as
# `just_vcf.ancestry.build_prive_reference` writes it, and reference-PCA panels in just-prs's layout.
# AADR's compatibility_HO release may sit at its top level or one directory down; the opt-in test
# then builds the aadr_ho panel from it. Only the opt-in tests read it; they skip when it is unset or missing.
# JUST_VCF_ANCESTRY_DIR=

# A real reference store (gtars refget, GRCh37 and GRCh38) for the opt-in tests that read an assembly,
# such as normalize against bcftools on a PGP-HMS upload. Only read. They skip when it is unset or missing.
# tests/test_chm13.py also needs a T2T-CHM13 collection in it (and skips without one).
# JUST_VCF_TEST_REFERENCE_DIR=

# UCSC chain files (hg38ToHs1.over.chain.gz, hs1ToHg38.over.chain.gz; docs/PROVENANCE.md) for the opt-in
# GRCh38<->T2T-CHM13 lift test. Only read; it skips when unset, missing, or without those two files.
# JUST_VCF_TEST_CHAIN_DIR=

# Illumina manifest zips (GSA-24v3-0 A1, OmniExpress-24 v1.2 A1; docs/PROVENANCE.md), found by the
# descriptor their [Heading] names. resolve_ref reads their indel probes to resolve an array's I/D codes
# (RM281), each manifest read once into a probe table under the cache's probes/; unset, those rows stay
# unread and a warning says why. The opt-in test that re-derives the packaged chip marker sample
# (just_vcf/chip_markers.json) reads them too and skips without them. Only read.
# JUST_VCF_MANIFESTS_DIR=

# somalier's two published site VCFs (sites.GRCh37.vcf.gz, sites.hg38.vcf.gz; docs/PROVENANCE.md) for the
# opt-in test that re-derives the relatedness panel shipped in the package (just_vcf/relatedness_sites.json),
# with JUST_VCF_TEST_REFERENCE_DIR. Only read; the test skips when it is unset or missing.
# JUST_VCF_RELATEDNESS_SITES_DIR=
